a discovery estimate about 0.036 with a zero-excluding interval but lower bound below the outcome_014 benchmark of about 0.0093. I reopen H114 as active and focus next analyses on whether feature_063 effects are coherent across outcomes (outcome_013, outcome_001, outcome_014 level_003, outcome_011), while also testing feature_045 on outcome_008 and outcome_011 and one feature_055 contrast, plus two broad 4-level categorical explorers. Acceptance for feature_063 will require a clinically interval-supported effect, preferably coherent main or subgroup effects or independent validation with a lower bound above the outcome-specific 10% benchmark; otherwise it will be closed. All conclusions remain dataset-specific associations, not causal or generalizable claims.",
